  <p id="c-liangshu-033-liuxiaochuo-opening-rendered:p001" annotation-status="named_mentions_first_pass" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-liangshu-033-liuxiaochuo-opening-rendered:p001:m0001" ref="va5_2sy_7kk_AA">劉孝綽</persName>字<persName id="c-liangshu-033-liuxiaochuo-opening-rendered:p001:m0002" ref="va5_2sy_7kk_AA">孝綽</persName>，彭城人，本名<persName id="c-liangshu-033-liuxiaochuo-opening-rendered:p001:m0003" ref="va5_2sy_7kk_AA">冉</persName>。祖<persName id="c-liangshu-033-liuxiaochuo-opening-rendered:p001:m0004" ref="va5_2sy_7kk">勔</persName>，宋司空忠昭公。父<persName id="c-liangshu-033-liuxiaochuo-opening-rendered:p001:m0005" ref="va5_2sy_7kk_A">繪</persName>，齊大司馬霸府從事中郎。</p>
